{"id":"exterior.http","number":"6.3","part":"exterior","kind":"leccion","title":[{"type":"text","text":"Hablar con internet"}],"minutes":30,"levels":["semilla","brote","arbol"],"needs":[{"id":"exterior.json","number":"6.2","title":"Datos que se entienden entre programas"}],"introduces":[{"id":"peticion","label":"petición"},{"id":"codigo-de-estado","label":"código de estado"}],"brief_problem":"El precio de la fruta importada","previous":{"id":"exterior.json","number":"6.2","title":"Datos que se entienden entre programas"},"next":{"id":"exterior.proyecto","number":"P·F","title":"Proyecto final: el kiosco completo"},"blocks":[{"type":"phrase","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"Un programa le pregunta algo a otro por internet enviando una petición, y la respuesta trae un código que dice cómo le fue."}]},{"type":"heading","id":"problema","number":"","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"El problema"}]},{"type":"problem","blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"La fruta importada cuesta "},{"type":"strong","text":"2 dólares"},{"type":"text","text":", y el kiosco cobra en pesos según el "},{"type":"strong","text":"tipo de cambio del día"},{"type":"text","text":", que publica un servicio en internet. A veces el servicio responde y a veces no."}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"strong","text":"¿Cuánto cobra hoy el kiosco por la fruta importada, y qué hace si el servicio no responde?"}]}]},{"type":"heading","id":"intentalo","number":"","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"Inténtalo"}]},{"type":"attempt","prompt":[{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"Si el servicio dice que un dólar vale 20 pesos, ¿cuánto cuesta la fruta? ¿Y si no responde?"}]}],"answer":[{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"strong","text":"40 pesos"},{"type":"text","text":". Si no responde, el kiosco no puede inventar un precio: avisa que el servicio no está disponible."}]}]},{"type":"cycle","phases":[1,2]},{"type":"phase_heading","id":"entender-planear","phases":[1,2],"runs":[{"type":"text","text":"Entender y planear"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"entries":[[{"type":"strong","text":"¿Qué entra y qué sale?"},{"type":"text","text":" Entra la respuesta del servicio; sale el precio en pesos o un aviso."}],[{"type":"strong","text":"¿A qué se parece?"},{"type":"text","text":" Al inventario de la lección anterior: un texto JSON que llega de afuera y hay que leer."}],[{"type":"strong","text":"¿Qué puede fallar afuera del programa?"},{"type":"text","text":" La red puede no estar, el servicio puede responder un error y la respuesta puede venir mal escrita."}]]},{"type":"heading","id":"herramienta","number":"","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"La herramienta nueva"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"Una "},{"type":"definition","term":"peticion","text":"petición"},{"type":"text","text":" le pide algo a otro programa por internet. Para enviarla, el programa pide la capacidad de red con "},{"type":"code","tokens":[["requestNetwork","identifier"]]},{"type":"text","text":", igual que pedía la de una carpeta. La respuesta trae un texto, el cuerpo, y un "},{"type":"definition","term":"codigo-de-estado","text":"código de estado"},{"type":"text","text":" que dice cómo le fue: 200 es bien; los que empiezan con 4 o con 5 son problemas."}]},{"type":"spec_figure","section":"biblioteca.http","number":"12.9","figure":{"type":"figure","id":"http-ida-vuelta","number":"12.9-1","alt":"Petición y respuesta","description":"El programa envía una petición GET al servidor y recibe una respuesta 200 con su cuerpo. Las respuestas, también 404 y 500, son Exito; los fallos de transporte son Error.","caption":[{"type":"text","text":"La petición sale por la capacidad de red y vuelve una respuesta. Un 404 o un 500 son respuestas, no errores: solo los fallos de transporte llegan como "},{"type":"code","tokens":[["IoError","type"]]},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"svg":"<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 340 170\" width=\"340\" height=\"170\"><title>Petición y respuesta</title><desc>El programa envía una petición GET al servidor y recibe una respuesta 200 con su cuerpo. Las respuestas, también 404 y 500, son Exito; los fallos de transporte son Error.</desc><rect x=\"6\" y=\"40\" width=\"96\" height=\"60\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#FF0003\" fill-opacity=\"0.1\" stroke=\"#FF0003\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"54\" y=\"74.2\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"IBMPlexSans\" fill=\"#FF0001\">programa</text><rect x=\"238\" y=\"40\" width=\"96\" height=\"60\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#FF000B\" fill-opacity=\"0.08\" stroke=\"#FF000B\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"286\" y=\"74.2\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"IBMPlexSans\" fill=\"#FF0001\">servidor</text><polyline points=\"104,56 228,56\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#FF0004\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><polygon points=\"236,56 228,60.5 228,51.5\" fill=\"#FF0004\"/><polyline points=\"236,86 112,86\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#FF0009\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><polygon points=\"104,86 112,81.5 112,90.5\" fill=\"#FF0009\"/><text x=\"170\" y=\"48\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"IBMPlexMono\" fill=\"#FF0004\">GET /hoy</text><text x=\"170\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"IBMPlexMono\" fill=\"#FF0009\">200 · Soleado, 25</text><text x=\"170\" y=\"134\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#FF0001\" font-family=\"IBMPlexSans\">200, 404, 500: Exito con la respuesta</text><text x=\"170\" y=\"156\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#FF000A\" font-family=\"IBMPlexSans\">sin conexión: Error(ErrorES)</text></svg>","layers":[],"steps":[],"panels":[]}},{"type":"program","id":"clima","title":"Pedir el tiempo que hace","source":"Subroutine ConsultarClima() As Result<String, IoError>\n  Define red As NetworkCap <- Propagate requestNetwork();\n  Define peticion As HttpRequest <- HttpRequest(HttpMethod.GET, \"https://clima.test/hoy\");\n  Define respuesta As HttpResponse <- Propagate red.send(peticion);\n  Write \"Estado: \", respuesta.status();\n  Return respuesta.textBody();\nEndSubroutine\n\nAlgorithm Clima\n  Switch ConsultarClima() Do\n    Success(texto): Write texto;\n    Failure(problema): Write problema.code;\n  EndSwitch\nEndAlgorithm\n","lines":[[["Subroutine","keywordProcedural"],[" "],["ConsultarClima","identifier"],["(","punctuation"],[")","punctuation"],[" "],["As","punctuation"],[" "],["Result","type"],["<","operator"],["String","type"],[",","punctuation"],[" "],["IoError","type"],[">","operator"]],[["  "],["Define","keywordStructured"],[" "],["red","identifier"],[" "],["As","punctuation"],[" "],["NetworkCap","type"],[" "],["<-","operator"],[" "],["Propagate","keywordStructured"],[" "],["requestNetwork","identifier"],["(","punctuation"],[")","punctuation"],[";","punctuation"]],[["  "],["Define","keywordStructured"],[" "],["peticion","identifier"],[" "],["As","punctuation"],[" "],["HttpRequest","type"],[" "],["<-","operator"],[" "],["HttpRequest","type"],["(","punctuation"],["HttpMethod","type"],[".","punctuation"],["GET","identifier"],[",","punctuation"],[" "],["\"https://clima.test/hoy\"","literalString"],[")","punctuation"],[";","punctuation"]],[["  "],["Define","keywordStructured"],[" "],["respuesta","identifier"],[" "],["As","punctuation"],[" "],["HttpResponse","type"],[" "],["<-","operator"],[" "],["Propagate","keywordStructured"],[" "],["red","identifier"],[".","punctuation"],["send","identifier"],["(","punctuation"],["peticion","identifier"],[")","punctuation"],[";","punctuation"]],[["  "],["Write","keywordStructured"],[" "],["\"Estado: \"","literalString"],[",","punctuation"],[" "],["respuesta","identifier"],[".","punctuation"],["status","identifier"],["(","punctuation"],[")","punctuation"],[";","punctuation"]],[["  "],["Return","keywordProcedural"],[" "],["respuesta","identifier"],[".","punctuation"],["textBody","identifier"],["(","punctuation"],[")","punctuation"],[";","punctuation"]],[["EndSubroutine","keywordProcedural"]],[],[["Algorithm","keywordStructured"],[" "],["Clima","identifier"]],[["  "],["Switch","keywordStructured"],[" "],["ConsultarClima","identifier"],["(","punctuation"],[")","punctuation"],[" "],["Do","keywordStructured"]],[["    "],["Success","literalBoolean"],["(","punctuation"],["texto","identifier"],[")","punctuation"],[":","punctuation"],[" "],["Write","keywordStructured"],[" "],["texto","identifier"],[";","punctuation"]],[["    "],["Failure","literalBoolean"],["(","punctuation"],["problema","identifier"],[")","punctuation"],[":","punctuation"],[" "],["Write","keywordStructured"],[" "],["problema","identifier"],[".","punctuation"],["code","identifier"],[";","punctuation"]],[["  "],["EndSwitch","keywordStructured"]],[["EndAlgorithm","keywordStructured"]]],"executed":true,"output":"Estado: 200\nSoleado, 25\n","termination":"completed","diagnostics":[]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"El servicio de este ejemplo no es real: el anfitrión de memoria responde en su lugar, siempre igual. Así el programa se puede probar sin internet."}]},{"type":"spec_links","links":[{"section":"biblioteca.http","number":"12.9","title":"HTTP"},{"section":"biblioteca.json","number":"12.8","title":"JSON"}]},{"type":"cycle","phases":[3]},{"type":"phase_heading","id":"escribir","phases":[3],"runs":[{"type":"text","text":"Escribir"}]},{"type":"program","id":"cambio","title":"La fruta importada","source":"Function pesos <- PrecioEnPesos(dolares As Integer, cambio As Integer)\n  Define pesos As Integer;\n  pesos <- dolares * cambio;\nEndFunction\n\nFunction mensaje <- MensajeDePrecio(cuerpo As String)\n  Define mensaje As String <- \"La respuesta no trae el cambio\";\n  Switch parseJson(cuerpo) Do\n    Success(datos):\n      Switch datos.field(\"dolar\") Do\n        Some(dolar):\n          Switch dolar.asInteger() Do\n            Some(cambio): mensaje <- \"Fruta importada: \" + toText(PrecioEnPesos(2, cambio)) + \" pesos\";\n            None: mensaje <- \"El cambio no es un número\";\n          EndSwitch\n        None: mensaje <- \"La respuesta no trae el cambio\";\n      EndSwitch\n    Failure(problema): mensaje <- \"Respuesta mal escrita en la columna \" + toText(problema.jsonColumn);\n  EndSwitch\nEndFunction\n\nSubroutine PedirCambio() As Result<String, IoError>\n  Define red As NetworkCap <- Propagate requestNetwork();\n  Define respuesta As HttpResponse <- Propagate red.send(HttpRequest(HttpMethod.GET, \"https://cambio.test/hoy\"));\n  If respuesta.status() <> 200 Then\n    Return Success(\"Servicio no disponible (\" + toText(respuesta.status()) + \")\");\n  EndIf\n  Define cuerpo As String <- Propagate respuesta.textBody();\n  Return Success(MensajeDePrecio(cuerpo));\nEndSubroutine\n\nAlgorithm FrutaImportada\n  Switch PedirCambio() Do\n    Success(mensaje): Write mensaje;\n    Failure(problema): Write \"Sin red: \", problema.code;\n  EndSwitch\nEndAlgorithm\n","lines":[[["Function","keywordProcedural"],[" "],["pesos","identifier"],[" "],["<-","operator"],[" "],["PrecioEnPesos","identifier"],["(","punctuation"],["dolares","identifier"],[" "],["As","punctuation"],[" "],["Integer","type"],[",","punctuation"],[" "],["cambio","identifier"],[" "],["As","punctuation"],[" "],["Integer","type"],[")","punctuation"]],[["  "],["Define","keywordStructured"],[" "],["pesos","identifier"],[" "],["As","punctuation"],[" "],["Integer","type"],[";","punctuation"]],[["  "],["pesos","identifier"],[" "],["<-","operator"],[" "],["dolares","identifier"],[" "],["*","operator"],[" "],["cambio","identifier"],[";","punctuation"]],[["EndFunction","keywordProcedural"]],[],[["Function","keywordProcedural"],[" "],["mensaje","identifier"],[" "],["<-","operator"],[" "],["MensajeDePrecio","identifier"],["(","punctuation"],["cuerpo","identifier"],[" "],["As","punctuation"],[" "],["String","type"],[")","punctuation"]],[["  "],["Define","keywordStructured"],[" "],["mensaje","id